// Vitest Snapshot v1, https://vitest.dev/guide/snapshot.html

exports[`verifies final files through a Loader-composed filesystem and removes the declaration tool on disposal 1`] = `"When a task produces files, call deliver_files with the COMPLETE final delivery list before your final reply. Exclude scratch files, conversion inputs, previews, helper scripts and intermediate documents unless the user requested them as outputs. The tool verifies existing files and replaces any earlier delivery list for this turn. Do not claim delivery if it fails. This tool declares files only; an empty list does not mean the task has no answer. For tasks without output files, you may omit the call or declare an empty list. Complete any file declaration before the final reply, then give the full requested answer, including text-only results. Do not replace the answer with a file-list acknowledgement or list processing files."`;
